    <string name="media_manage_body">When videos move to Private, Android asks \u201cAllow %1$s to delete these videos?\u201d every time.\n\nAllow media management so Android stops asking every time: tap Open settings, turn on \u201cAllow app to manage media\u201d, then come back.\n\nThis only lets %1$s edit and delete videos and pictures without asking. It doesn\'t give access to your other files.</string>
